# ── Privacy Policy Page ──
msgid "Information We Collect"
msgstr "Taarifa Tunazokusanya"

msgid "We collect only the information necessary to manage your clan membership, including your name, email address, phone number, gender, birth date, and clan affiliation. Profile photos are optional."
msgstr "Tunakusanya tu taarifa muhimu kusimamia uanachama wako wa ukoo, ikiwemo jina lako, anwani ya barua pepe, nambari ya simu, jinsia, tarehe ya kuzaliwa, na ushiriki wa ukoo. Picha za profaili ni hiari."

msgid "How We Use Your Information"
msgstr "Jinsi Tunavyotumia Taarifa Zako"

msgid "Your information is used solely for clan management purposes: membership records, contribution tracking, family tree genealogy, event coordination, and clan communication. We never sell or share your data with third parties."
msgstr "Taarifa zako zinatumika kwa madhumuni ya usimamizi wa ukoo pekee: rekodi za uanachama, ufuatiliaji wa michango, nasaba ya mti wa familia, uratibu wa matukio, na mawasiliano ya ukoo. Hatujawahi kuuza au kushirikisha data yako na watu wengine."

msgid "Data Security"
msgstr "Usalama wa Data"

msgid "Your data is protected with industry-standard security measures. Access to personal information is restricted to authorized clan leaders and administrators based on their assigned roles."
msgstr "Data yako inalindwa kwa hatua za usalama za kiwango cha sekta. Ufikiaji wa taarifa binafsi umezuiwa kwa viongozi walioidhinishwa na wasimamizi kulingana na majukumu waliyopewa."

msgid "Your Rights"
msgstr "Haki Zako"

msgid "You have the right to view, update, or request deletion of your personal data. Contact your clan leadership or system administrator for assistance."
msgstr "Una haki ya kuona, kusasisha, au kuomba kufutwa kwa data yako binafsi. Wasiliana na uongozi wa ukoo wako au msimamizi wa mfumo kwa usaidizi."

msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Mawasiliano"

msgid "For privacy-related inquiries, please contact your clan administrator."
msgstr "Kwa maswali yanayohusu faragha, tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi wa ukoo wako."

msgid "Data Controller"
msgstr "Mdhibiti wa Data"

msgid "This system is operated by the Clan Administration Team. All data collected is managed under their authority. For any privacy-related inquiries, contact your clan leadership."
msgstr "Mfumo huu unaendeshwa na Timu ya Utawala wa Ukoo. Data zote zilizokusanywa zinasimamiwa chini ya mamlaka yao. Kwa maswali yoyote ya faragha, wasiliana na uongozi wa ukoo wako."

msgid "We collect and process the following categories of information:"
msgstr "Tunakusanya na kuchakata aina zifuatazo za taarifa:"

msgid "Third-party services used for authentication, hosting, or analytics (if applicable)"
msgstr "Huduma za watu wengine zinazotumika kwa uthibitisho, upangishaji, au uchambuzi (kama inatumika)"

msgid "While we implement strong security measures, no digital system can guarantee absolute security. Users are encouraged to protect their login credentials."
msgstr "Ingawa tunatumia hatua kali za usalama, hakuna mfumo wa kidigitali unaoweza kuhakikisha usalama kamili. Watumiaji wanashauriwa kulinda vitambulisho vyao vya kuingia."

msgid "Request a copy of your data (data portability)"
msgstr "Omba nakala ya data yako (uhamishaji wa data)"

msgid "Request deletion of your account data (subject to legal retention rules)"
msgstr "Omba kufutwa kwa data ya akaunti yako (kwa kuzingatia sheria za uhifadhi)"

msgid "Eligibility"
msgstr "Ustahiki"

msgid "This system is intended for authorized clan members only. Users must comply with internal clan membership rules and governance policies."
msgstr "Mfumo huu unakusudiwa kwa wanachama wa ukoo walioidhinishwa pekee. Watumiaji lazima wafuate sheria za uanachama wa ukoo na sera za utawala."

msgid "Last Updated: May 2026"
msgstr "Imesasishwa Mwisho: Mei 2026"

msgid "Acceptance of Terms"
msgstr "Kukubali Masharti"

msgid "By using the BUBABI Clan Management System, you agree to these terms of service and the clan constitution. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the system."
msgstr "Kwa kutumia Mfumo wa Usimamizi wa Ukoo wa BUBABI, unakubali masharti haya ya huduma na katiba ya ukoo. Kama hukubali, tafadhali acha kutumia mfumo."

msgid "Account Responsibilities"
msgstr "Majukumu ya Akaunti"

msgid "You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You agree to provide accurate information and keep it updated. You are responsible for all activities under your account."
