msgstr "Matumizi Yanayokubalika"

msgid "You agree to use the system in accordance with clan rules and regulations. Harassment, fraud, misrepresentation, or any behavior that violates clan governance is prohibited and may result in account suspension or removal."
msgstr "Unakubali kutumia mfumo kwa kufuata sheria na kanuni za ukoo. Unyanyasaji, udanganyifu, upotoshaji, au tabia yoyote inayokiuka utawala wa ukoo ni marufuku na inaweza kusababisha kusimamishwa au kuondolewa kwa akaunti."

msgid "Financial Transactions"
msgstr "Miamala ya Kifedha"

msgid "All financial contributions, loans, and fines recorded in this system are subject to clan governance rules. The system provides tracking and verification but does not process actual payments. Disputes should be resolved through clan leadership."
msgstr "Michango yote ya kifedha, mikopo, na faini zilizorekodiwa kwenye mfumo huu zinategemea sheria za utawala wa ukoo. Mfumo unatoa ufuatiliaji na uthibitisho lakini hauchakati malipo halisi. Migogoro inapaswa kutatuliwa kupitia uongozi wa ukoo."

msgid "Modifications"
msgstr "Mabadiliko"

msgid "These terms may be updated by clan leadership. Continued use of the system after changes constitutes acceptance of the modified terms."
