msgid "Governing Rules"
msgstr "Sheria za Utawala"

msgid "This system operates under the BUBABI clan constitution and governance framework. In case of conflict, the clan constitution takes precedence."
msgstr "Mfumo huu unafanya kazi chini ya katiba ya ukoo wa BUBABI na mfumo wa utawala. Katika kesi ya mgongano, katiba ya ukoo inachukua nafasi ya kwanza."

